  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9E%AC%EC%9B%8C%EC%A3%BC%EB%8A%94-%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4/2986), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60609584)  \nTae-eun', who came from the provinces and lived in a shabby old house, gave up on a pretty house in the evening. I live to save even a little bit, but the desire to live in a nice house is growing day by day.\n\nI live alone in a nice house\n\nWith the scars of letting go of the cat I had been raising due to the stress of serialization\n\n'Jungmoon', a webtoon writer who can't sleep well\n\nFirst, he meets Tae-eun, who resembles the cat in appearance and even the feel of his fur, and falls into a sound sleep.\n\nSleep is essential to life.\n\nBecause he desperately needed that sleep, Jeong-moon made Tae-eun an offer that was difficult to refuse despite the embarrassment...",
